WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:08.350
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:14.860
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:16.690
It's my day!

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:27.270
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:34.680
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:42.050
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:49.460
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:55.230
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.740 --> 00:01:02.370
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:09.880
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:16.020
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:19.090
I just want to walk

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:22.630
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:26.600
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.570 --> 00:01:35.510
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.510 --> 00:01:41.950
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:44.220
It's my day!

00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:48.820
Bookstore

00:01:56.460 --> 00:01:58.360
Here it is! <i>Treasures...</i>

00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:02.030
That model, Jun, is such a total hottie!

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:05.700
And he's on the cover! Isn't he cute?

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:10.270
Oh... Isn't this...?

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:20.280
"Shock! Another Red Card!"

00:02:21.050 --> 00:02:22.790
Did you see the new issue
of <i>Treasures?</i>

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:26.220
I sure did.
What's she doing modeling?

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:30.230
And she's on the cover!
With Junpei! Damn her!

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:33.480
How'd that hog wind up
with that job?

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:37.100
She probably used a dirty tactic to get
her way into it. I wouldn't put it past her.

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:53.580
<i>W-why's it so ominous in here?</i>

00:03:05.130 --> 00:03:06.100
Tsukushi...

00:03:06.630 --> 00:03:07.930
What is it, Makiko?

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:09.370
Here...

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:16.740
<i>No way!</i>

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:25.250
You said it wouldn't be published!

00:03:25.250 --> 00:03:27.320
Why is it on the cover?

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:30.210
I'm not sure myself.

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:32.820
I guess the editors liked that shot.

00:03:33.490 --> 00:03:35.330
But you look cute in the picture.

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:40.770
Why don't you take up modeling?

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:43.030
I quit!

00:03:44.770 --> 00:03:49.410
I quit being your friend. You just don't
understand where I'm coming from.

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:51.980
You've ruined everything.

00:03:52.340 --> 00:03:54.350
All I want is to live a quiet life.

00:03:54.780 --> 00:03:57.680
I don't care whether I look cute, or not!

00:03:58.550 --> 00:04:01.060
It may be all right for you,
since you're in disguise here,

00:04:01.060 --> 00:04:02.620
but it's really annoying for me.

00:04:02.990 --> 00:04:08.360
Please don't be angry. I apologize.
I'm really sorry.

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:10.530
Stop it, will you?!

00:04:10.530 --> 00:04:12.990
No, no! I won't let you go
until you forgive me.

00:04:12.990 --> 00:04:16.580
Okay, okay! I forgive you!
So let me go!

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:17.870
You'll really forgive me?

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:20.300
I said I would, didn't I?
I forgive you!

00:04:21.170 --> 00:04:23.540
Listen, you'd better not do this again!

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:32.250
<i>Domyoji...</i>

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:36.150
What's up with this guy?
Who is he?

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:40.460
<i>Yikes! If he finds out
Junpei's a model,</i>

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:42.160
<i>there's no telling
what he'll do...</i>

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:44.600
He's no one special...

00:04:45.100 --> 00:04:47.970
I'm Tsukushi's boyfriend.

00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:49.330
<i>What?!</i>

00:04:50.340 --> 00:04:51.700
Boyfriend?

00:04:52.340 --> 00:04:54.370
Hey, what are you saying?!

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:58.380
Well, in English, a male friend
is a <i>boy</i> friend, right?

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:00.610
Isn't that right, Domyoji?

00:05:05.220 --> 00:05:07.990
What are you thinking, Makino?

00:05:08.390 --> 00:05:10.430
Getting yourself
in some tacky magazine...

00:05:10.430 --> 00:05:12.920
...and flirting with a zero like him...

00:05:13.360 --> 00:05:14.630
You think you're hot stuff, huh?

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:17.530
I-it's none of your business!

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.360
He's jealous!

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:23.300
I'm right, aren't I?

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:26.700
What are you saying, Junpei? Stop it!

00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:28.710
Stay out of this, Makino.

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:34.280
When Makino isn't in your sight,
you're uneasy...

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:38.580
If she doesn't do what you want,
you get mad...

00:05:41.590 --> 00:05:43.290
You're crazy about her,
aren't you?

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:44.820
You...

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:48.230
Do you know what you're saying?

00:05:48.690 --> 00:05:53.000
What are you talking about?
Or should I let my fists do the talking?

00:05:53.460 --> 00:05:54.470
Domyoji!

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:57.070
Why don't we put it all
on the table...

00:05:57.570 --> 00:05:58.040
Makino...

00:05:59.940 --> 00:06:01.410
Do you like this guy?

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:08.150
This guy who acts so immature?

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:12.620
What do you care?

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:14.790
You'd better be honest...

00:06:15.190 --> 00:06:19.290
...or he'll always be meddling
in your life.

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:24.300
<i>Oh, come on...</i>

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:30.840
<i>My feelings for Domyoji go beyond
simple liking or disliking...</i>

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:38.380
He's put you through a lot
up till now, right?

00:06:39.180 --> 00:06:40.350
He's a jerk!

00:06:42.650 --> 00:06:43.950
What do you know?

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:44.980
Stop!

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:48.220
Stop it!

00:06:50.190 --> 00:06:50.990
Stop it!

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:56.530
Stop it, will you?

00:07:17.350 --> 00:07:21.250
I... I don't like anybody!

00:07:37.340 --> 00:07:38.700
Domyoji...

00:07:39.340 --> 00:07:42.010
When I'm with you,
I feel like I'm suffocating.

00:07:46.880 --> 00:07:50.070
I feel like I'm going to
be crushed...

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:53.150
...by the power you wield
over this school.

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:57.660
Domyoji... 
You've done a lot for me...

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:06.860
but I want to find a more 
private, quiet happiness.

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:11.440
I want to get away from you
and the F4.

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:16.970
I've got to get away.

00:08:19.540 --> 00:08:22.350
Please... leave me alone.

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:51.510
Let's go, Makino.

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:54.510
Don't cry.

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:06.020
I...

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:14.470
I love you so much,
it's messing with my mind.

00:09:18.470 --> 00:09:19.970
I want only you.

00:09:23.440 --> 00:09:25.610
Haven't you said enough, Domyoji?

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:30.110
Makino... I don't give up easily.
If you run, I'll come after you.

00:09:30.110 --> 00:09:32.780
I'll go to hell or anywhere...
if that's what it takes.

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:34.450
No way...

00:09:36.350 --> 00:09:38.490
I'll run after you and catch you!

00:09:41.290 --> 00:09:44.060
<i>It can't be... I can't believe it...</i>

00:09:48.430 --> 00:09:50.170
Pull yourself together, Makino.

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:52.340
Let's go.

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:03.820
<i>Domyoji feels that way about me?</i>

00:10:05.420 --> 00:10:06.950
<i>Can it be true?</i>

00:10:18.860 --> 00:10:19.700
Jun?

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:23.030
It's that model, Jun, from <i>Treasures!</i>

00:10:30.140 --> 00:10:31.840
What's he doing here?

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:40.890
<i>I'll protect you, Makino...</i>

00:10:42.650 --> 00:10:46.890
<i>I'll protect you from this
evil world.</i>

00:10:53.330 --> 00:10:56.000
<i>Domyoji... loves me?</i>

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:42.050
<i>I don't believe it.</i>

00:11:43.950 --> 00:11:45.650
<i>I want only you.</i>

00:11:47.190 --> 00:11:50.390
<i>I remember what he said to me
at his home.</i>

00:11:51.360 --> 00:12:00.000
<i>But... I still loved Rui Hanazawa and
betrayed Domyoji terribly.</i>

00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:04.540
<i>And yet...</i>

00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:10.010
<i>He put his life on the line to save me,
and he lent me money.</i>

00:12:11.610 --> 00:12:12.610
<i>Was that...</i>

00:12:15.110 --> 00:12:18.850
<i>because he still loves me?</i>

00:12:27.190 --> 00:12:30.930
<i>I don't know what's what anymore...</i>

00:12:38.600 --> 00:12:40.240
See you! I have to go to work.

00:12:40.470 --> 00:12:41.860
Yeah. See you tomorrow.

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:42.510
Okay.

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:51.650
<i>I've got to work hard and repay
the million yen he lent me.</i>

00:12:52.350 --> 00:12:56.420
<i>Repay him so that I'll no longer
be in his debt. Otherwise...</i>

00:12:56.890 --> 00:12:57.420
Boo!

00:12:58.220 --> 00:13:00.020
Oh, Junpei!

00:13:00.020 --> 00:13:02.690
Makino... let's go home together.

00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:05.600
Why aren't you wearing your glasses?

00:13:05.600 --> 00:13:08.830
They're going to find out
that you work as a model!

00:13:09.230 --> 00:13:11.170
The secret's already out.

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:15.640
B-but you don't know what they'll do
to you if you stick out.

00:13:17.240 --> 00:13:18.710
I don't care.

00:13:22.310 --> 00:13:24.150
I've given up hiding myself.

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:28.220
I want to be true to myself, like you are.

00:13:29.150 --> 00:13:30.820
You understand, don't you?

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:33.590
How I feel...

00:13:35.530 --> 00:13:36.860
<i>Junpei...</i>

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:41.670
Watch out!

00:13:54.350 --> 00:13:56.980
What... What was that?

00:13:57.650 --> 00:13:59.220
Someone's out to get us.

00:14:00.080 --> 00:14:01.510
Someone?

00:14:01.510 --> 00:14:03.320
It's probably Domyoji.

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:07.990
W-what are you saying?
He'd never do something like this.

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:09.730
How would you know?

00:14:14.070 --> 00:14:18.840
That classroom's nearest the hallway
where the F4 hang out.

00:14:19.700 --> 00:14:20.570
But...

00:14:24.740 --> 00:14:27.980
Besides, he acted
pretty strangely yesterday.

00:14:29.310 --> 00:14:33.950
Still... I don't think
Domyoji would be so underhanded.

00:14:35.050 --> 00:14:35.950
But...

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:39.990
Anyway, I don't think
we should be together.

00:14:40.390 --> 00:14:41.290
Makino...

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:42.130
See you...

00:15:02.010 --> 00:15:06.180
<i>Junpei has his fans, too...
Who could it be?</i>

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:08.450
<i>There are too many enemies to tell.</i>

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:10.250
Makino!

00:15:12.860 --> 00:15:14.390
Have you seen Tsukasa?

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:17.760
No, no I haven't. Not today.

00:15:18.130 --> 00:15:21.270
That's funny... He's vanished.

00:15:22.430 --> 00:15:23.840
<i>Domyoji's vanished?</i>

00:15:24.300 --> 00:15:25.940
We called his home,
but he's not there.

00:15:26.370 --> 00:15:29.840
Did he go to his villa?
Have you heard anything?

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:31.740
No, I haven't.

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:35.180
You modeled for <i>Treasures,</i> didn't you?

00:15:35.680 --> 00:15:38.180
I hear that Jun is a student here.

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:41.790
Be careful. Tsukasa's not going to
take this lying down.

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:44.720
He can be pretty vicious,
you know.

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:55.370
<i>No way! It can't be!</i>

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:15.750
<i>I don't want to think he'd do it, but...</i>

00:16:42.380 --> 00:16:43.450
<i>A red card...</i>

00:16:46.650 --> 00:16:51.590
<i>The brilliant red looks like
a farewell from Domyoji...</i>

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:05.900
<i>Rather than being frightened...</i>

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:08.170
<i>I feel sad...</i>

00:17:09.040 --> 00:17:12.580
<i>...to think I hurt him so badly.</i>

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:21.570
Let's hang out here till class is over.

00:17:21.570 --> 00:17:25.160
Tsukushi Makino's something else,
to get another red card!

00:17:26.420 --> 00:17:27.660
<i>Word's already gotten out.</i>

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:32.350
Makino's stupid to hang out
with that model, Jun.

00:17:32.350 --> 00:17:34.550
He stands out too much.

00:17:34.550 --> 00:17:36.970
Maybe he'll get creamed
along with her.

00:17:38.100 --> 00:17:40.940
<i>Don't tell me Junpei got
a red card, too!</i>

00:17:45.510 --> 00:17:46.210
Who's there?!

00:17:46.780 --> 00:17:48.510
<i>Oh, no... They'll get me!</i>

00:17:50.180 --> 00:17:51.320
Tsukushi Makino...

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:54.490
You've fallen right into our hands.

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:55.820
<i>Uh-oh!</i>

00:18:00.090 --> 00:18:01.490
<i>Thank goodness it was
the second floor.</i>

00:18:02.490 --> 00:18:03.030
Ouch!

00:18:03.760 --> 00:18:04.260
<i>My knee...</i>

00:18:04.830 --> 00:18:05.400
Hey!

00:18:15.470 --> 00:18:18.110
What happened to our usual
Tsukushi Makino?

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:19.180
Hey!

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:24.300
<i>If this is the price I 
pay for hurting Domyoji...</i>

00:18:24.300 --> 00:18:27.720
<i>...it can't be helped.
No matter what happens to me...</i>

00:18:29.320 --> 00:18:30.520
Quit it, will you?

00:18:33.160 --> 00:18:35.030
You enjoy hitting girls?

00:18:35.360 --> 00:18:37.830
So... the model is here?

00:18:38.160 --> 00:18:41.430
Back off, or you'll never be able
to work as a model again!

00:18:52.210 --> 00:18:53.980
Jun... pei...

00:18:54.480 --> 00:18:58.420
I'm sorry to be late. I'll protect you.

00:19:00.120 --> 00:19:02.420
<i>You mustn't, Junpei...</i>

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:08.830
<i>These guys are crazy.
You'll lose...</i>

00:19:14.330 --> 00:19:16.730
What? You wanna fight?

00:19:18.270 --> 00:19:19.100
Want to?

00:19:21.940 --> 00:19:24.180
Well, don't you sound brave...

00:19:25.540 --> 00:19:28.350
...when all you can do
is beat up girls.

00:19:28.910 --> 00:19:30.750
Quit flapping your lips and
come and get me.

00:19:31.050 --> 00:19:31.820
You...!

00:19:34.550 --> 00:19:35.690
We'd be happy to!

00:19:38.160 --> 00:19:39.620
My eyes! I can't see!

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:49.430
What a coward... 
throwing sand at us!

00:19:51.170 --> 00:19:52.840
What are you saying?

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:56.770
Who's the bigger coward?
I'd say it's the one who hit a girl.

00:20:04.980 --> 00:20:05.920
Makino!

00:20:09.950 --> 00:20:10.860
Makino!

00:20:16.090 --> 00:20:18.030
Are you all right?
Pull yourself together.

00:20:19.730 --> 00:20:21.630
Where am I? Ow...

00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:25.730
No... Don't try to get up.

00:20:25.730 --> 00:20:27.410
I fainted...

00:20:28.310 --> 00:20:31.040
Don't worry. I paid them back.

00:20:31.310 --> 00:20:31.940
Huh?

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:35.450
Just kidding.

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:40.280
Actually, I ran away.
You know, you're so heavy!

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:43.010
I don't know how many times
I thought I'd leave you behind!

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:45.620
I know...
I look thinner than I am.

00:20:47.330 --> 00:20:47.860
You!

00:20:50.090 --> 00:20:52.360
I'll get something to drink. Wait here.

00:20:53.160 --> 00:20:53.730
OK.

00:21:00.240 --> 00:21:00.810
Ouch...

00:21:02.810 --> 00:21:08.050
<i>What should I do from here on?
I can't keep running away...</i>

00:21:22.390 --> 00:21:23.330
Makino?

00:21:24.900 --> 00:21:25.860
Makino?

00:22:05.440 --> 00:22:11.510
You let your hair down a little

00:22:13.480 --> 00:22:19.420
You hid the fact
that you were crying

00:22:21.190 --> 00:22:29.260
I noticed, but I
couldn't ask you why

00:22:29.530 --> 00:22:37.340
I can never be
honest about how I feel

00:22:37.340 --> 00:22:45.080
Until after we've split
up after a bad fight

00:22:45.380 --> 00:22:53.220
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:22:45.380 --> 00:22:53.220
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:22:53.220 --> 00:23:01.630
I can say "I love you"...

00:22:53.220 --> 00:23:01.630
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:03.390 --> 00:23:11.370
Do you really hate me this time?

00:23:11.370 --> 00:23:19.180
Will you end up running to him?

00:23:19.410 --> 00:23:27.320
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:23:19.410 --> 00:23:27.320
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:27.320 --> 00:23:35.730
I can say "I love you"...

00:23:27.320 --> 00:23:35.730
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:47.810 --> 00:23:51.310
Captured by four punks,
a dark shadow looms before me.

00:23:51.710 --> 00:23:53.410
What are you doing?

00:23:54.450 --> 00:23:56.980
You're using me to lure Domyoji out?

00:23:57.780 --> 00:24:00.920
What a laugh! He'll never come.

00:24:01.720 --> 00:24:02.790
Not him...

00:24:03.390 --> 00:24:06.560
Hana Yori Dango:
"Domyoji... Won't Come?"

00:24:07.260 --> 00:24:09.330
Why did you come? You idiot!
